{
    "title": "Word Connect - Train Brain",
    "description": "<b>Word Connect</b> is a very fun word puzzle game. Word Connect puzzle game is so interesting and it helps you to train your brain & improve your vocabulary. If you love playing word puzzle games, or you want to learn more words, this word connect puzzle game is really a good choice. If you are tired after work or study, you can play this word puzzle game for several minutes, it will relax your body and your mind. You can also play this word connect word game every day for several minutes; it will calm your mind not only by word puzzles but also by bringing you to beautiful landscapes and soothing music.\r\n\r\nWord Connect has more than <b>10000+ word puzzles</b> waiting for you. You will have a good sleep after you solve several word puzzles at night. Also when you are trying to learn more words, this word connect game make your study interesting. You can swipe the letters to connect them into the hidden words, you need to recognize or guess the hidden words from the jumble letters! If you don't know any words, you can use the free word translation feature to get the meanings. If you find any additional words not in the hidden words, these words will be taken as bonus words. Accumulating the bonus words can get gift box.\r\n\r\nDaily word puzzles make the word connect game more challenging. If you are a or trying to be a word game master, you would love the word daily challenges. There are three daily word puzzles to challenge every day, you can choose one you loved mostly or you can challenge all of them.\r\n\r\nWord Connect gets 200+ <b>beautiful backgrounds</b> of landscapes, animals, castles, and so on. The backgrounds are so beautiful making you feel good and feel like traveling around the world. You will unlock these backgrounds by opening the star chests. The star chests will be opened by playing the word connect puzzle games, and the star chests also provide you more gifts.\r\n\r\n<b>Word Connect</b> has many <b>abandoned gardens</b> and <b>messy rooms</b>, you can play word connect puzzle games to repair and design them. With your elaborate design, the gardens will come to life and the rooms will acquire completely new outlooks.\r\n\r\nGood features:\r\n\u266b Easy and fun\r\n\u266b 10000+ word puzzles waiting for playing\r\n\u266b 200+ beautiful backgrounds waiting for unlocking\r\n\u266b Tens of abandoned gardens & messy rooms waiting for repairing and designing\r\n\u266b Daily puzzles and challenge\r\n\u266b Star Chests\r\n\u266b Word hints, letter shuffle, rockets and planes to reveal letters\r\n\u266b Word translation\r\n\u266b Bonus words\r\n\r\nMore word puzzles, backgrounds, abandoned gardens, and messy rooms will be added. And Word Connect will be more and more interesting. Let's play it!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Word Connect</b> is a very fun word puzzle game. Word Connect puzzle game is so interesting and it helps you to train your brain &amp; improve your vocabulary. If you love playing word puzzle games, or you want to learn more words, this word connect puzzle game is really a good choice. If you are tired after work or study, you can play this word puzzle game for several minutes, it will relax your body and your mind. You can also play this word connect word game every day for several minutes; it will calm your mind not only by word puzzles but also by bringing you to beautiful landscapes and soothing music.<br><br>Word Connect has more than <b>10000+ word puzzles</b> waiting for you. You will have a good sleep after you solve several word puzzles at night. Also when you are trying to learn more words, this word connect game make your study interesting. You can swipe the letters to connect them into the hidden words, you need to recognize or guess the hidden words from the jumble letters! If you don&#39;t know any words, you can use the free word translation feature to get the meanings. If you find any additional words not in the hidden words, these words will be taken as bonus words. Accumulating the bonus words can get gift box.<br><br>Daily word puzzles make the word connect game more challenging. If you are a or trying to be a word game master, you would love the word daily challenges. There are three daily word puzzles to challenge every day, you can choose one you loved mostly or you can challenge all of them.<br><br>Word Connect gets 200+ <b>beautiful backgrounds</b> of landscapes, animals, castles, and so on. The backgrounds are so beautiful making you feel good and feel like traveling around the world. You will unlock these backgrounds by opening the star chests. The star chests will be opened by playing the word connect puzzle games, and the star chests also provide you more gifts.<br><br><b>Word Connect</b> has many <b>abandoned gardens</b> and <b>messy rooms</b>, you can play word connect puzzle games to repair and design them. With your elaborate design, the gardens will come to life and the rooms will acquire completely new outlooks.<br><br>Good features:<br>\u266b Easy and fun<br>\u266b 10000+ word puzzles waiting for playing<br>\u266b 200+ beautiful backgrounds waiting for unlocking<br>\u266b Tens of abandoned gardens &amp; messy rooms waiting for repairing and designing<br>\u266b Daily puzzles and challenge<br>\u266b Star Chests<br>\u266b Word hints, letter shuffle, rockets and planes to reveal letters<br>\u266b Word translation<br>\u266b Bonus words<br><br>More word puzzles, backgrounds, abandoned gardens, and messy rooms will be added. And Word Connect will be more and more interesting. Let&#39;s play it!",
